S|          EXT. CROWD SCENES. VARIOUS.
O|
O|
N|          A massive crowd, it could be a sports stadium, a u2 farewell
N|          show or new year's eve on copacabana beach, but whatever it
N|          is there are thousands and thousands of us. A mexican wave
N|          erupts success, celebration, with so many involved it's
N|          impossible to pick out anyone individually. Critical mass
N|          cyclists, easter crowds at st. Peter's basilica, nyc
N|          marathon, 4,000 flash mobbers doing the silent disco at
N|          london's victoria station, india's kumbh mela, macy's
N|          thanksgiving day parade, raves, subway parties, the daytona
N,G|          500. . . . Gradually the screen splits into 2, and then 3,
N,G|          though at times there appears to be no division at all.                          
