N|          Even uphill he hammers his way up the sandstone. Gasping for
N|          oxygen, his legs screaming for rest, he pushes and pushes
N|          until the crest and then down, down, instant speed and he can
N|          suck on his water again. Part of a massive clan who define
N|          themselves not by what they are, but by what they do. In a
N|          way, he's an action movie personified and the opening should
N|          be shot and cut to provide adrenaline in spadefuls.
