M|                         " SATURDAY NIGHT ":
N,G|          We pass through the transparent title on our way along the
N,G|          canyon. Half dark. We're on a wind blowing dust through the
N|          canyon walls, to find a miner in the distance digging into
N|          the rock. It's Aron of course, and his head-lamp is filled
N|          with the dust swirling through. He's using the shorter file
N|          from the multi tool and has tied a shoe lace to his wrist and
N|          looped through the ring at the end of the tool. He pulls his
N|          cap down, to keep most of the dust out of his eyes. His lips
N|          are caked but he keeps blowing on his arm, to keep it clear.
