S|          INT/EXT. VARIOUS.
O|
M|          The rest of Tuesday and night, and Wednesday and night play
M,G|          out through the triptych. Repetition is used to create a
M|          trippy sense of losing coherence- sometimes there's 3 Arons
M|          doing the same thing. It could be consecutive days or he's
M|          forgotten.
O|
O|                         
M,G|          At key moments it resolves to one image and then back again.
M,G|          Things seem to loop and his close-ups almost seem to watch
M|          the loops happening again and again. This is particularly
M|          true inside the head bag at night. When his light is switched
M,G|          on it's bleached and monstrously overlit, like cruel HD close-
M,G|          up - his disintegration is terrifying.
O|
O|                         
M,G|          When it's off we establish a night vision, of green, of blue,
M,G|          that allows us to witness him in hiding. The images,
M,G|          sometimes of himself also, play out on the interior surface
M,G|          of the bag. The effect is like wraparound Imax, multi-screen
M,G|          Technicolor.
